    {
      "id": "dark-02-fall",
      "stepLabel": "02 DARK — Part 1",
      "layout": "stamped",
      "title": "Sin separates us from God",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Humanity is inherently sinful, and our actions oppose God's nature. Sinful thoughts and behaviors—such as hatred, lust, anger, selfishness, and rebellion—separate us from God and hinder our fellowship with Him. Just as Satan was cast out of heaven for his sin, our sin also prevents fellowship with God and keeps us from His presence after death."
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "type": "next",
          "label": "Continue",
          "nodeId": "dark-02-fall-next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dark-03-law",
      "stepLabel": "02 DARK — Part 2",
      "layout": "stamped",
      "title": "The law",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "God gave us His law to help us understand right from wrong and to convict us of our sins and our need for forgiveness. The Bible states, \"All have sinned and fall short of the glory of God\" (Romans 3:23). To be in His presence, we must be perfect as He is. However, God cannot overlook sin; His justice demands accountability, and the penalty is death and separation from Him."
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "type": "next",
          "label": "Continue",
          "nodeId": "dark-03-law-next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dark-scripture-rom319",
      "stepLabel": "02 DARK — Scripture",
      "layout": "stamped",
      "title": "Romans 3:19",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Now we know that whatever the law says, it says to those who are under the law, that every mouth may be stopped, and all the world may become guilty before God. [Romans 3:19]"
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "type": "next",
          "label": "Continue",
          "nodeId": "dark-scripture-rom319-next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "red-01-title",
      "stepLabel": "03 RED — Title",
      "layout": "stamped",
      "title": "03 Saved by Jesus (THE SOLUTION)",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "RED >>"
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
