    {
      "id": "green-02-new-creation",
      "stepLabel": "05 GREEN — Part 1",
      "layout": "stamped",
      "title": "New creation",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Those who are saved will be transformed by God's power, and the evidence of salvation is a changed life: 'Therefore, if anyone is in Christ, he is a new creation; old things have passed away; behold, all things have become new' (2 Corinthians 5:17). While we won't be perfect until Jesus returns, those who trust God will seek to honor His Word and live according to His will."
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "type": "next",
          "label": "Continue",
          "nodeId": "green-02-new-creation-next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "green-03-fruit",
      "stepLabel": "05 GREEN — Part 2",
      "layout": "stamped",
      "title": "Good works God prepared",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Believing in Jesus is just the beginning of the Christian life; we must allow God to remove worldly influences and prepare our lives for the good works He has for us. We demonstrate our love for God by loving others and sharing the good news about Jesus. We are not saved by our good works, but we are saved to do the good works that God has prepared for us! [Ephesians 2:10]"
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "type": "next",
          "label": "Continue",
          "nodeId": "green-03-fruit-next"
        }
      ]
    },
