          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "IX Not bear false witness (liar) — Have you ever told a lie? (Tell the truth)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "X Shall not Covet (greedy) — Ever desired your neighbor's possessions?"
