          "text": "Of those who believe in Jesus, few are willing to surrender to Him—and that's the hard part. God offers you the incredible gift of eternal life through His Son, Jesus, if you're willing to give up your life in exchange. There is nothing you can do to earn salvation but to receive it by faith. This is when we are born into God's kingdom or born-again."
