          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Now that you understand what God requires for salvation, what's holding you back? Many believe that simply acknowledging Jesus and being baptized is enough, leading some to think they can still live for themselves and neglect God. But true salvation requires leaving our old lives behind to follow Him fully."
