      "layout": "stamped",
      "title": "Married to God.",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Christianity is a covenant with God, where we commit to belong to Him alone. It's a lifelong devotion to renounce our old life, love God fully, and serve Him. Jesus invites all to join as His 'bride' and promises to return, having prepared a place to dwell together forever. This is the commitment God requires—a love that responds to His own."
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
