      "layout": "stamped",
      "title": "Honor and consequence",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Though belief isn't forced, we were all created to honor Him, and rejecting His call bears the grave consequence of being denied entry to His kingdom."
        }
