      "title": "His kingdom",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "In the same way, serving God means doing things His way. As Christians, we seek to understand His will and honor Him through our choices. We represent His kingdom when we follow His ways and misrepresent Him when we don't. Just as there are earthly rewards and consequences for following or breaking rules, there are eternal ones based on how we respond to God's authority by obeying the Scriptures in the Bible."
